  "body": "Positioned in the sought-after coastal community of Red Beach, 5 Surf View Crescent presents an exciting opportunity to secure a generous section and bring your dream home to life.\r\n\r\nSet across approximately 630sqm of land, the property offers plenty of scope to design and build a home that reflects your lifestyle, whether you are planning a modern family residence, a relaxed coastal retreat, or something uniquely your own.\r\n\r\nThe location brings together the best of coastal living and everyday convenience, with beautiful beaches, local schools, shops, amenities and transport connections all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWith land of this size becoming increasingly difficult to secure in established coastal communities, this is an opportunity to create something special in a location you can enjoy for years to come.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* Approx. 630sqm section\r\n* Design and build your dream home\r\n* Sought-after Red Beach location\r\n* Close to beaches, schools and local amenities\r\n* Excellent opportunity for families, builders or land buyers\r\n* Secure the land, shape your vision and make Red Beach home.\r\n\r\nContact James today for further information or to arrange a site visit.",
